  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Completed the reviewed Root API port and approved wrapper surface. Included 53 common Root operations and three optional capability operations for ADINA export and analysis messages, with exact candidate-build policies and native signature checks. Added named results, typed options, bounded retrieval, XML IntelliSense and packaged usage guides. Validated 1,547 offline tests and 217 installed-package XML examples against managed stand-ins. Targets Windows and .NET Framework 4.8.1; live STAAD compatibility validation remains pending. Full release notes: https://github.com/structuraldeveloper/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
